# What never belongs in the build context. Two reasons, and the second is the one that bites:
# a smaller context is faster, and a context that carries host-built artefacts can make the image
# differ from a clean checkout without anyone noticing.

# Host-built and host-specific
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
.ci

# Not the application
.git
.github
docs
tools
e2e
scratchpad
*.md
!apps/api/README.md

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode

# Never, under any circumstances
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
